WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.950
I grew up here, and I was always a bit
scared, because the bridge used to sway.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.050
Both pedestrians and vehicles used it.

3
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:20.150
When a lorry came over, the
bridge would sway and you felt

4
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.950
like everything was moving under your feet.

